      "text": "🚨 WILD Border Chase Near Winterhaven, CA! 🚨\nOn April 30, 2026, a vehicle disguised as a construction truck was spotted driving erratically near the Andrade Port of Entry. When Border Patrol agents tried to stop it, the driver sped off-road and dozens of passengers bailed out, sprinting toward the Colorado River, hoping to escape!\n\nWithin moments, a #YumaAirBranch helicopter aircrew was on the scene, scanning the dense riverside vegetation from above. \n\nThe aircrew quickly spotted multiple suspects and expertly guided ground agents to their hiding spots.  \n\nThanks to this rapid aerial response and teamwork, 22 illegal aliens were apprehended after a dramatic pursuit.\n\n#Teamwork #USBP #AMO #BorderSecurity",
